{"unit_id":"somnusovis__dsh-multi-workspace#card-zh","repo":"somnusovis/dsh-multi-workspace","commit":"96cd8427bd72d8a70e7590191ca058c40eb17c87","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-workspace 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的多工作区文件写入插件。它接入 sandboxPolicy、workspaceRegistry 和 fs 服务，在策略解析时把其他已登记工作区加入额外可写根目录，并包装 writeText、editText，在原操作因 FS_SANDBOX_DENIED 失败后逐个根目录重试。用户因此可通过文件工具写入或编辑多个工作区中的文件；插件卸载时会恢复原方法。适合需要跨工作区管理文件的场景，无需 API key 或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/index.js:12-17","dist/index.js:19-43","dist/index.js:45-104"]}
{"unit_id":"somnusovis__dsh-multi-workspace#card-en","repo":"somnusovis/dsh-multi-workspace","commit":"96cd8427bd72d8a70e7590191ca058c40eb17c87","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-multi-workspace lets DSH Web file tools write and edit across registered workspaces. It adds paths to sandboxPolicy and retries writeText or editText after FS_SANDBOX_DENIED. It uses DSH workspace and file services, restores wrapped methods on cleanup, and needs no API key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/index.js:12-17","dist/index.js:19-43","dist/index.js:45-104"]}
