{"unit_id":"somnusovis__dsh-multi-workspace#caveat-1","repo":"somnusovis/dsh-multi-workspace","commit":"96cd8427bd72d8a70e7590191ca058c40eb17c87","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-workspace 使用前须知：代码在文件工具遭沙箱拒绝后，会对其他已登记工作区以 workspace-write 重试；它包装的是文件服务，未扩展命令行写入路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/index.js:45-95"]}
